# HyperFrames clip sources: keep the composition, drop the render byproducts
design/clips/*/renders/
design/clips/*/out/
design/clips/*/work/
design/clips/*/snapshots/
design/clips/*/node_modules/
# Cafénista's tools/build.sh writes its lossless PNG masters one level up, to design/clips/work/build/<cut>/
design/clips/work/
# The film (design/clips/film/tools/build.sh): each cut's staged media/ (sting intermediates, the bed, the faces,
# including the build-time copy of Apple's New York, which must never be committed). film/work/ is covered above.
design/clips/film/*/media/
design/clips/film/*/snapshots/
design/clips/film/*/renders/
# The film's music is a licensed Pixabay track (design/clips/film/tools/music.sh). The licence forbids redistributing
# the music on its own and the repo is public: neither the track nor the 40 s cut is ever committed — only the films.
design/clips/film/assets/music/
design/clips/film/assets/bed.m4a
